 "marks": [
  {
   "d": "2022-04-29",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Due to the two recent acquisitions made by the Company, the net assets as at 31 March 2022 were £911,017. We expect this to increase once accounts have been readjusted to account for the acquisition of the Gravelotte emerald mine.",
   "file": "20220429_GEMR_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-29",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We expect to be in a position to announce the maiden JORC resource and CPR in the near future but meanwhile I would say we are highly encouraged by the results so far",
   "file": "20220929_GEMR_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-21",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "The establishment of a maiden JORC resource estimation of this magnitude for the Gravelotte Emerald Mine is a truly exceptional achievement. The combined JORC mineral resource of 29 million carats of contained emeralds far exceeded our expectations.",
   "file": "20221121_GEMR_DrillingProduction-Report.md",
   "gnote": "early signal: first step up in tone"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-04-28",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "This is way beyond our reasonable expectations - even based on the smaller figure above there are many years of mine life at potentially very profitable levels of production remaining.",
   "file": "20230428_GEMR_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-09-01",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The past six months have seen substantial progress towards recommencing production and the Directors believe it is on track to begin initial mining operations in the coming months.",
   "file": "20230901_GEMR_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-02-19",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "With a substantial ore stockpile ready for processing and the optical sorter's components being systematically assembled, we remain on-track with the commission and restart of mining and processing operations on schedule.",
   "file": "20240219_GEMR_Operational-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-04-29",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Following the successful commissioning of our processing and sorting plants, phased production at GEM commenced as scheduled before the end of April 2024 and within budget",
   "file": "20240429_GEMR_Production-Begins-at-Gravelotte-Emerald-Mine.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-07-22",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We are on track for our first trial sales later H2 2024, and I am particularly proud that we have achieved this without any lost time injuries or reportable accidents.",
   "file": "20240722_GEMR_Gravelotte-Mine-Production-and-Operational-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-09-09",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Our gems will be sold through an auction process, and we are currently preparing a modest first trial lot, with the first test auction sale currently planned by Bonas Group (\"Bonas\") for late September 2024.",
   "file": "20240909_GEMR_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-09-17",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "The small first trial sale, initially scheduled for September as part of a far larger auction to be conducted by Bonas Group, has been postponed due to export delays to Thailand.",
   "file": "20240917_GEMR_Gravelotte-Emerald-Mine-Sales-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-11-05",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Upon completing the planned processing plant upgrades, GEM will shortly initiate active mining in both the Cobra and Discovery open pits.",
   "file": "20241105_GEMR_Operational-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-01-13",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "The timing of the auction will depend on the volume and quality of material mine and stockpiled, as well as the annual auction schedule managed by Bonas Group.",
   "file": "20250113_GEMR_Operational-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-02-12",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "We look forward to further scaling our operations and remain on track for our first sale in the first half of the year.",
   "file": "20250212_GEMR_DrillingProduction-Report.md",
   "gnote": "early signal: first step up in tone"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-04-03",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "GEMR is actively working towards its first trial sale of emeralds and expects to provide the market with further details in the near term.",
   "file": "20250403_GEMR_Operational-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-09-26",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "While the gemstone market remains subdued, GEMR now has the operational progress, strengthened financial position, and new strategic initiatives required to advance Gravelotte and Curlew, while also establishing innovative financing and marketing channels.",
   "file": "20250926_GEMR_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2026-09-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY26",
